%N A399883 On Artin's conjecture, (A399882(n)/a(n))*C is the relative density of primes with primitive root -n among the primes, where C = A005596 is Artin's constant.
%C A399883 a(n) is odd for all n.
%C A399883 For n > 1, a(n) = 1 if and only if n is A120629; see comments in A399880 for more details.
%H A399883 Jianing Song, <a href="/A399883/b399883.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%H A399883 Oleksiy Klurman, Igor E. Shparlinski, and Joni Teräväinen, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1112/blms.70103">On Artin's conjecture on average and short character sums</a>. Bull. London Math. Soc., 57 (2025): 2429-2443.
